# songgeneration-mcp — Cursor rules

## Session Context
Backends tried in order: Lyria (cloud/GCP) → ACE-Step (:8001) → MusicGen →
Stable Audio → Studio SG2 (:10930). Check `GET /api/v1/diagnostics` before
promising generation. Lyrics: `;` separators, English lines end with `.`
before `;`, SG2 length tags for timing. Skill: `skills/SKILL.md`.

## Commands
- `just serve` backend :10885 · `just test` pytest · `just lint` ruff+biome
